%% Data Flow Diagram — Week 6
%% Shows how data moves through the RAG pipeline.
%% Render at: https://mermaid.live

flowchart LR
    subgraph Indexing ["Indexing Phase (once)"]
        Doc[📄 Documents] --> Chunk[Chunker]
        Chunk --> Embed1[Embedder]
        Embed1 --> Index[(FAISS Index)]
    end

    subgraph Query ["Query Phase (per request)"]
        Q[❓ User Question] --> Embed2[Embedder]
        Embed2 --> Retrieve[Retrieve top-k chunks]
        Index --> Retrieve
        Retrieve --> Prompt[Build prompt + context]
        Prompt --> LLM[🤖 LLM]
        LLM --> Answer[✅ Answer]
    end
